			        How is it calculated?
			    </div>
			
			    <div style='font-size:11px;line-height:1.5;margin-bottom:16px;'>
			        We first identify the Referrals created during the selected
			        period, then count the <b>distinct families</b> associated
			        with those Referrals.
			    </div>
			
			    <!-- INFO BOX -->
			    <div style='
			        width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;
			        background:#F5F5F5;border-radius:7px;padding:11px 12px;
